    <item>
      <title>Gallery</title>
      <link>https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/gallery/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/gallery/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The gallery shortcode enables you to transform a folder in your asset directory into an image gallery. You can see it in action on the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/elements/&#34;&gt;Elements page&lt;/a&gt;. To show an image gallery, write the following &amp;lsquo;code&amp;rsquo;:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;{{&amp;lt; gallery dir=&amp;#34;/uploads/gallery/&amp;#34; &amp;gt;}} &#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;!--&#xD;&#xA;&lt;ul class=&#34;image-gallery&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/uploads/gallery/01_hu_6d8960e761e2c84b.jpg&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;img src=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/uploads/gallery/01_hu_ad06ac10382ad0da.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Image 01&#34; /&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/uploads/gallery/02_hu_a373ca9d41af8eaa.jpg&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;img src=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/uploads/gallery/02_hu_94392580cd7b1c6b.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Image 02&#34; /&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/uploads/gallery/03_hu_8aed9965b1a313db.jpg&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;img src=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/uploads/gallery/03_hu_e8d1efa7dcce03f.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Image 03&#34; /&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/uploads/gallery/04_hu_e0d58fd1ad0b662.jpg&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;img src=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/uploads/gallery/04_hu_eea18716c445eed1.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Image 04&#34; /&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/uploads/gallery/05_hu_9fbb661df88016f.jpg&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;img src=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/uploads/gallery/05_hu_dcf36576b8226653.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Image 05&#34; /&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;&#xA; --&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Map</title>
      <link>https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/map/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/map/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;A map is basically &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/uploads/map.png&#34;&gt;an image&lt;/a&gt; with a marker on top of it. The marker can be found in the &amp;lsquo;/static/img/&amp;rsquo; directory. Make sure to make your map image large enough, as it does not scale. The minimum size is a 900x400 pixel image. You can see the map shortcode in action on the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/elements/&#34;&gt;Elements page&lt;/a&gt;. To show the map in your content, write the following shortcode:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;{{&amp;lt; map &amp;#34;/uploads/map.png&amp;#34; &amp;#34;https://link.to.map.location&amp;#34; &amp;gt;}}&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;!--&lt;p class=&#34;map&#34; style=&#34;cursor: pointer; background: url(/uploads/map.png) center calc(50% + 2rem)&#34; onclick=&#34;window.open(&#39;https:\/\/link.to.map.location&#39;)&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Social buttons</title>
      <link>https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/socialbuttons/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/socialbuttons/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;If you want to link to social media you can use the social media buttons shortcode. The settings for these icons can be found in the &amp;lsquo;footer.yaml&amp;rsquo; file in the data directory. You can see the social buttons in action on the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/elements/&#34;&gt;Elements page&lt;/a&gt;. To show the social buttons, write the following shortcode:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;{{&amp;lt; socialbuttons &amp;gt;}}&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;!--&#xD;&#xA;&lt;ul class=&#34;buttons social&#34;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://facebook.com&#34; class=&#34;button icon&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/img/facebook.svg&#34; alt=&#34;Facebook&#34; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://twitter.com&#34; class=&#34;button icon&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/img/twitter.svg&#34; alt=&#34;Twitter&#34; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://joinmastodon.org&#34; class=&#34;button icon&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/img/mastodon.svg&#34; alt=&#34;Mastodon&#34; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://instagram.com&#34; class=&#34;button icon&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/img/instagram.svg&#34; alt=&#34;Instagram&#34; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;--&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Subpages</title>
      <link>https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/subpages/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/subpages/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Sometimes, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/&#34;&gt;like here&lt;/a&gt;, you want to show a list of the subpages. This shortcode makes that really easy. It outputs a simple unordered list with links. To show the subpages, write the following shortcode:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;{{&amp;lt; subpages &amp;gt;}}&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;!--&lt;ul&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;            &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/breadcrumbs/&#34;&gt;Breadcrumbs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;            &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/button/&#34;&gt;Button&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;            &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/contactbuttons/&#34;&gt;Contact buttons&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;            &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/contact-form/&#34;&gt;Contact form&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;            &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/cta-form/&#34;&gt;CTA form&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;            &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/faq/&#34;&gt;F.A.Q.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;            &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/gallery/&#34;&gt;Gallery&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;            &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/map/&#34;&gt;Map&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;            &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/socialbuttons/&#34;&gt;Social buttons&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;            &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/subpages/&#34;&gt;Subpages&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;            &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/tabs/&#34;&gt;Tabs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;            &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/video/&#34;&gt;Video&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;            &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/youtube/&#34;&gt;Youtube&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;--&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Tabs</title>
      <link>https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/tabs/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/tabs/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;You can see the form in action on the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/elements/&#34;&gt;Elements page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;{{&amp;lt; tabs &amp;gt;}}&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;## Tab1&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Aliquam et dictum sem.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;---&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;## Tab2&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Aliquam et dictum sem.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;{{&amp;lt; /tabs &amp;gt;}}&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;!--&lt;ul class=&#34;tabs&#34;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#tab_&#34; onclick=&#34;toggleTab(this); return false;&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;tabs_container&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;tab&#34; id=&#34;tab_&#34;&gt;Empty shortcode found.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;script&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    function toggleTab(el) {&#xD;&#xA;        var els = el.parentElement.parentElement.querySelectorAll(&#39;li&#39;);&#xD;&#xA;        els.forEach(function(el) {&#xD;&#xA;            el.classList.remove(&#39;selected&#39;);&#xD;&#xA;        });&#xD;&#xA;        var els = el.parentElement.parentElement.nextElementSibling.querySelectorAll(&#39;.tab&#39;);&#xD;&#xA;        els.forEach(function(tab) {&#xD;&#xA;            tab.style.display = &#39;none&#39;;&#xD;&#xA;        });&#xD;&#xA;        el.parentElement.classList.add(&#39;selected&#39;)&#xD;&#xA;        el.parentElement.parentElement.nextElementSibling.querySelector(el.getAttribute(&#39;href&#39;)).style.display = &#39;&#39;;&#xD;&#xA;    }&#xD;&#xA;    var els = document.querySelectorAll(&#39;.tabs&#39;);&#xD;&#xA;    els.forEach(function(instance) {&#xD;&#xA;        instance.querySelector(&#39;li:first-child a&#39;).click();&#xD;&#xA;    });&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/script&gt;--&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Video</title>
      <link>https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/video/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/video/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The video shortcode enables you to put an HTML5 video in your project. You can see it in action on the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/elements/&#34;&gt;Elements page&lt;/a&gt;. To show a HTML5 video, write the following &amp;lsquo;code&amp;rsquo;:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;{{&amp;lt; video &amp;#34;/uploads/video/flowers.mp4&amp;#34; &amp;gt;}} &#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;!--&#xD;&#xA;&lt;figure &gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;video playsinline controls class=&#34;player&#34; preload=&#34;metadata&#34; data-poster=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;source src=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/uploads/video/flowers.mp4&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;p&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      Your browser does not support HTML5 video.&#xD;&#xA;      Here is &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/uploads/video/flowers.mp4&#34;&gt;&#34;&gt;a link to download the video&lt;/a&gt;.&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/p&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/video&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt; --&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Youtube</title>
      <link>https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/youtube/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/docs/shortcodes/youtube/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Youtube is a popular video streaming service ( from a company that is known for tracking and profiling, though). The solution is to host the poster yourself and link it to Youtube. This can be done using this shortcode.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;You can see it in action on the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/elements/&#34;&gt;Elements page&lt;/a&gt;. To show a Youtube video embed, write the following &amp;lsquo;code&amp;rsquo;:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;{{&amp;lt; youtube &amp;#34;qtIqKaDlqXo&amp;#34; &amp;#34;/uploads/youtubeposter.jpg&amp;#34; &amp;gt;}} &#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;!--&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;shortcode-youtube&#34; href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qtIqKaDlqXo&#34; title=&#34;Play Youtube video&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://www.hugobricks.preview.usecue.com/uploads/youtubeposter_hu_531d4920cf3f0981.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Youtube video qtIqKaDlqXo&#34; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; --&gt;</description>
    </item>
  </channel>
